@1 = ~Yeah?~
@2 = ~Sorry to bother you.~
@3 = ~Yeah?~
@4 = ~We are investigating the ghost sighting. What can you tell me about it?~
@5 = ~Bye.~
@6 = ~It appeared in our room a couple nights ago. Apparently, some kids saw him even earlier. As the eldest child here, I felt a sense of responsibility and protection over the others. I tried to rationalise it, offer some sort of scepticism but... I struggled. I don't know what that spectre was but I am hoping you can find out.~
@7 = ~That weird smell I felt though...~
@8 = ~What smell?~
@9 = ~When the spirit manifested I felt an odour of... flowers? Like almonds? That sweet scent. It came out of nowhere. Mia and Kevin didn't feel anything, I asked them. Only me. Weirdly enough, they were closer to this being than me, so why was I the only person to smell it?~
@10 = ~My bed is by the window. If you're willing to check it go ahead. Maybe wait until it's the night-time? He manifest then, usually.~
@11 = ~Thank you.~
